{"duration_api_ms":9097,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3c31463d-cb11-4968-822a-ecec8478c1b3","total_cost_usd":0.028440000000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1399,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":862,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":99},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1399,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":862,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1399,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1399},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":862,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1399,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028440000000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":99,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Ticket Classification: Customer Support\n\n## Input\n- **User:** `user_a`\n- **Query:** \"The delivery is late and I want a refund for the parcel.\"\n\n## 1. Category Decision\nThe query matches keywords from both categories, so it is a **mixed-intent** ticket.\n\n| Category | Matched keywords |\n|---|---|\n| `delivery` | \"delivery\", \"late\", \"parcel\" |\n| `refund` | \"refund\" |\n\nThe frozen `mixed_intent_precedence` order is `[\"delivery\", \"refund\"]`, so delivery wins.\n\n**Primary category: `delivery` (Delivery / Shipping)**\n**Secondary intent: `refund` (Refund / Return)**. This is recorded but not used for routing.\n\n## 2. Routing Decision\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `delivery` |\n| **owner_team** | Logistics Support |\n| **priority** | P2 |\n| **sla** | 1 business day |\n\n## 3. Policy Application\nThe frozen delivery policy says to check tracking status first. If the delivery is delayed beyond the promised window, the agent should create a logistics investigation ticket and offer status follow-up.\n\n- The customer says the parcel is late. The data does not confirm that it is delayed beyond the promised window. Tracking status and the promised window are both unknown, so the delay must be verified before the investigation ticket is justified.\n- The refund request is kept as a secondary intent. The refund policy requires checking order eligibility and payment status before routing to Billing Support. No refund eligibility is assumed or promised at this stage.\n\n## 4. Next Actions (from the delivery policy)\n1. Confirm order number and tracking status.\n2. Open a logistics investigation ticket.\n3. Send customer a delivery status response.\n\n**Follow-up note for the secondary refund intent:** after the delivery review, check refund eligibility and payment transaction status. Route to Billing Support only if the refund criteria are met.\n\n## 5. Missing Information\nThese facts were not supplied, and none have been invented:\n- Order number\n- Tracking number and current tracking status\n- Promised delivery window and expected delivery date\n- How late the parcel is\n- Payment transaction status and refund eligibility criteria\n- Details of the refund criteria. The policy only says \"if eligible.\"","ttft_ms":2219,"type":"result","duration_ms":9134,"uuid":"ed7e256a-1405-412c-bb50-a534687e007d","ttft_stream_ms":1419,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":1420,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
